The Salamander profile is a locally maintained, key-derived construction
inspired by the public salt-and-BLAKE2b design of Hysteria 2 Salamander:
https://github.com/apernet/hysteria

It is not source-copied from Hysteria, does not depend on the reference
checkout, and is intentionally not wire-compatible with Hysteria: wg-quic
adds a per-packet peer-selection hint and derives its key from the existing
WireGuard key material.
